{
   "_comment": "Config for imageupdater. 'ref' is the image path exactly as it appears in your html/css today; the tool replaces that substring everywhere it is found and then rewrites 'ref' here so the next update keeps working. Sizes are recommendations only (px) - edit them freely.",
